<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak FinMin sets 4-week T-bill auction for Wed.</title>
<headline>Slovak FinMin sets 4-week T-bill auction for Wed.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak finance ministry on Wednesday will auction an unspecified tranche of four-week T-bills, the National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Monday.</p>
<p>In the ministry's last successful auction of simmilar T-bills on September 18, the average yield hit 8.185 percent, after 8.671 percent on July 24.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-210-3687</p>
</text>
